feat(shipping): the shipping domain joins — rate cards and the shipment tracking rows

Two services, 12 standard RPCs: ShippingRateService (the per-region
fee cards — base fee, per-unit fee, the ACTIVE/INACTIVE status) and
ShipmentService (the per-order tracking rows — carrier, tracking
number, the PENDING/SHIPPED/DELIVERED walk, the tracking-events
text). The golden DDL grows the two tables (shipments indexed by
order).

The status spellings follow the demo data on both sides of the
mapping (the stored bare-member names, the proto values at the
boundary).

verified over the live stack: the admin rate card lands (北京
800+200/CNY, ACTIVE), the shipment for the PAID test order lands
(SF Express, SHIPPED), and both rows read back from the database
